+# TITAN V3 S17 optimization-safe exact-tree hardening
+
+Operation: `TITAN-V3-S17-OPTIMIZATION-SAFE-EXACT-TREE-COMPOSITION-20260910-01`
+
+This source successor composes two released integrity repairs into the authenticated S17
+one-tree handoff. It does not change a gameplay lane, a shipped configuration default,
+the canonical archive, the expected built archive, a package pointer, provider state, or
+Kaggle submission state.
+
